i bi-trophy\"></i></div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"stat-label\">Experience</p>\n<p class=\"stat-title\">Senior Research Analyst</p>\n<p class=\"stat-sub\">Feedsense AI &bull; Live Trading Systems</p>\n</div>\n:::\n\n::: {.stat-item}\n<div class=\"stat-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-graph-up-arrow\"></i></div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"stat-label\">Specialization</p>\n<p class=\"stat-title\">Statistics &amp; ML</p>\n<p class=\"stat-sub\">Quant Modeling &bull; Forecasting</p>\n</div>\n:::\n\n::: {.stat-item}\n<div class=\"stat-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-code-slash\"></i></div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"stat-label\">Tools</p>\n<p class=\"stat-title\">Python, R, SQL</p>\n<p class=\"stat-sub\">Pandas &bull; Scikit-learn &bull; PostgreSQL</p>\n</div>\n:::\n:::\n\n:::\n:::\n\n::: {.connect-section}\n<p class=\"connect-label\"><span></span>Connect with me<span></span></p>\n<div class=\"connect-links\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/iamkkmcmd/\" class=\"connect-btn\"><i class=\"bi bi-github\"></i> GitHub</a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/iamkkmcmd\" class=\"connect-btn\"><i class=\"bi bi-linkedin\"></i> LinkedIn</a>\n  <a href=\"mailto:iamkkmcmd@gmail.com\" class=\"connect-btn\"><i class=\"bi bi-envelope\"></i> Email me</a>\n  <a href=\"https://twitter.com/iamkkmcmd\" class=\"connect-btn\"><i class=\"bi bi-twitter\"></i> Twitter</a>\n  <a href=\"https://facebook.com/iamkkmcmd\" class=\"connect-btn\"><i class=\"bi bi-facebook\"></i> Facebook</a>\n  <a href=\"https://instagram.com/iamkkmcmd\" class=\"connect-btn\"><i class=\"bi bi-instagram\"></i> Instagram</a>\n</div>\n:::\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n::: {.hero-section}\n::: {.hero-grid}\n\n::: {.hero-photo}\n<img src=\"./asset/img/Krishnakanta_Maity_Photo.jpg\" alt=\"Krishnakanta Maity\" class=\"hero-img\"/>\n:::\n\n::: {.hero-content}\n\n<h1 class=\"hero-title\">Krishnakanta <span class=\"accent-text\">Maity</span></h1>\n\n<span class=\"hero-badge\"> Statistician <span class=\"dot\">&bull;</span> Data Scientist <span class=\"dot\">&bull;</sp